WEBVTT

00:00:45.254 --> 00:00:48.966
PERFECT CROWN

00:00:59.851 --> 00:01:01.060
THIS IS A WORK OF FICTION

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:03.062
CHILD ACTORS AND ANIMALS WERE FILMED SAFELY

00:03:12.567 --> 00:03:17.280
PERFECT CROWN

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:19.241
An accident?

00:03:19.741 --> 00:03:20.991
What have you heard exactly?

00:03:20.992 --> 00:03:23.369
Only that there was a collision.

00:03:27.457 --> 00:03:28.834
I need to be there.

00:03:30.669 --> 00:03:32.086
Do not just stand there.

00:03:32.087 --> 00:03:33.712
Prepare to leave at once!

00:03:33.713 --> 00:03:34.965
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:03:37.884 --> 00:03:43.390
THE ROYAL SEOUL HOSPITAL

00:03:46.643 --> 00:03:48.395
How did this happen?

00:03:48.979 --> 00:03:50.062
What about His Majesty?

00:03:50.063 --> 00:03:52.232
Was there an attack on His Majesty's life?

00:03:53.567 --> 00:03:55.192
Say something!

00:03:55.193 --> 00:03:56.570
Please calm down, Your Majesty.

00:04:00.240 --> 00:04:03.325
His scans reveal no fractures or internal injuries.

00:04:03.326 --> 00:04:05.202
Just some minor bruising.

00:04:05.203 --> 00:04:06.455
:cue

00:04:29.186 --> 00:04:30.270
And the Grand Prince?

00:04:30.854 --> 00:04:32.731
I heard he was at the scene as well.

00:04:33.482 --> 00:04:34.900
Is he all right?

00:04:37.944 --> 00:04:39.237
He is in surgery.

00:04:39.946 --> 00:04:42.449
It appears his left shoulder bore much of the impact.

00:04:43.283 --> 00:04:45.952
It seems he has done everything in his power to stop the car.

00:04:47.078 --> 00:04:48.079
Prime Minister Min.

00:04:50.207 --> 00:04:51.208
May I have a word?

00:05:06.681 --> 00:05:09.266
Photos of the accident have spread on social media.

00:05:09.267 --> 00:05:10.976
Her conspicuous vehicle didn't help.

00:05:10.977 --> 00:05:13.145
How is Ms. Seong doing?

00:05:13.146 --> 00:05:16.066
She's still unconscious, but the scans have come back clean.

00:05:16.900 --> 00:05:20.152
Hmm. Are photos of the escort vehicles also circulating?

00:05:20.153 --> 00:05:23.572
No. They were some distance away from the scene,

00:05:23.573 --> 00:05:25.407
and we're removing them as they appear.

00:05:25.408 --> 00:05:26.492
That should be enough.

00:05:26.493 --> 00:05:27.993
Pushing too hard will raise--

00:05:27.994 --> 00:05:29.287
What did you just say?

00:05:33.166 --> 00:05:36.127
What does Ms. Seong Huiju have to do with any of this?

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:44.302
Are you saying the vehicle involved,

00:05:45.053 --> 00:05:47.848
the one His Majesty was in, belongs to that woman?

00:05:54.729 --> 00:05:55.730
Your Majesty.

00:06:00.193 --> 00:06:01.236
Where are you going?

00:06:04.489 --> 00:06:06.658
Must I report such things to you?

00:06:12.163 --> 00:06:13.164
The wise decision

00:06:14.165 --> 00:06:16.626
would be to not go anywhere.

00:06:19.462 --> 00:06:22.090
The people know Ms. Seong's vehicle was involved.

00:06:23.049 --> 00:06:24.133
So?

00:06:24.134 --> 00:06:25.968
"His Majesty was in that car

00:06:25.969 --> 00:06:28.304
and the Grand Prince caused an accident to save him,

00:06:28.305 --> 00:06:31.725
racking up countless traffic violations and substantial damage in the process."

00:06:32.350 --> 00:06:34.018
If word of this got out,

00:06:34.019 --> 00:06:35.020
all of this could be blamed

00:06:36.146 --> 00:06:37.230
on the young king.

00:06:39.065 --> 00:06:40.149
Prime Minister Min.

00:06:40.150 --> 00:06:42.402
I am merely stating that it could lead

00:06:43.153 --> 00:06:44.279
to such dire conclusions.

00:06:46.865 --> 00:06:48.533
Are you trying to protect that maiden?

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:52.329
I am trying to protect the Crown.

00:07:00.503 --> 00:07:02.380
OPERATING CENTER

00:07:03.798 --> 00:07:05.050
LEE ♪ IN RECOVERY

00:07:11.723 --> 00:07:13.058
The surgery went well.

00:07:13.558 --> 00:07:15.267
The anesthesia has just worn off,

00:07:15.268 --> 00:07:18.355
so he should be able to go up to his room in about an hour.

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:22.399
What about any lasting effects?

00:07:22.400 --> 00:07:26.570
I heard it can be difficult to use your arm after shoulder surgery.

00:07:26.571 --> 00:07:29.239
The surgery wasn't due to a fracture or a chronic condition,

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:30.367
so that is unlikely.

00:07:31.034 --> 00:07:32.451
- No need to worry. - Thank you.

00:07:32.452 --> 00:07:34.287
- Thank you, Doctor. - Thank you.

00:07:35.705 --> 00:07:36.997
Thank goodness.

00:07:36.998 --> 00:07:38.291
- That's a relief. - Yes.

00:08:03.566 --> 00:08:06.235
Let's increase security on the floor Ms. Seong is on.

00:08:06.236 --> 00:08:08.070
- Send people from our office. - Yes, sir.

00:08:08.071 --> 00:08:10.030
Let me know as soon as she wakes up.

00:08:10.031 --> 00:08:11.241
Yes, sir. :cue

00:08:24.504 --> 00:08:26.047
SEONG HUIJU

00:09:04.002 --> 00:09:06.087
Ms. Seong.

00:09:08.715 --> 00:09:09.799
Your Majesty?

00:09:10.467 --> 00:09:12.260
Are you awake?

00:09:15.472 --> 00:09:17.474
Your Majesty! Are you all right?

00:09:18.516 --> 00:09:19.850
Is anything broken?

00:09:21.519 --> 00:09:22.645
I am sorry.

00:09:24.314 --> 00:09:27.192
This all happened because I insisted on a drive.

00:09:30.737 --> 00:09:31.738
Not at all.

00:09:32.947 --> 00:09:34.991
Your Majesty and I are both fine.

00:09:39.079 --> 00:09:40.455
Wait, His Royal Highness.

00:09:41.164 --> 00:09:43.248
Where is the Grand Prince? Is he here as well?

00:09:43.249 --> 00:09:44.917
Do not worry.

00:09:44.918 --> 00:09:47.544
Uncle did not faint.

00:09:47.545 --> 00:09:50.006
He even went into the operating room without crying.

00:09:50.507 --> 00:09:52.633
The operating room?

00:09:52.634 --> 00:09:55.011
He's having surgery?

00:09:55.762 --> 00:09:58.264
Would you like some water?

00:09:59.015 --> 00:10:00.599
Is the surgery over?

00:10:00.600 --> 00:10:01.601
Are you okay?

00:10:03.937 --> 00:10:06.188
I mean, what were you thinking, jumping in there?

00:10:06.189 --> 00:10:07.273
Are you insane?

00:10:07.774 --> 00:10:10.984
Ms. Seong, His Royal Highness has just woken up from the anesthesia…

00:10:10.985 --> 00:10:12.612
- You can't just-- - Hold on.

00:10:13.404 --> 00:10:15.656
You even hurt your face?

00:10:15.657 --> 00:10:17.826
When that's all you have going for you?

00:10:24.874 --> 00:10:25.875
Oh, no.

00:10:27.252 --> 00:10:28.253
How are you doing?

00:10:32.507 --> 00:10:33.508
You were unconscious.

00:10:36.594 --> 00:10:37.637
I'm perfectly fine.

00:10:49.816 --> 00:10:50.817
Come here.

00:10:56.030 --> 00:10:57.157
I'm hurting.

00:11:26.311 --> 00:11:27.437
Anywhere else?

00:11:29.939 --> 00:11:30.940
I'm fine.

00:11:46.873 --> 00:11:48.791
Don't ever jump in like that again.

00:11:52.086 --> 00:11:54.672
I need to you stay in one piece so you can have my back.

00:11:55.882 --> 00:11:57.841
You were lucky this time.

00:11:57.842 --> 00:12:00.469
Imagine if your life was in danger…

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:02.931
You think it would end with just a few eggs?

00:12:03.473 --> 00:12:05.433
Then stop putting me in that position. :cue

00:12:08.519 --> 00:12:09.812
I can't promise you that.

00:12:11.189 --> 00:12:12.357
Then I can't either.

00:12:15.109 --> 00:12:18.029
You make it seem like you're madly in love with me.

00:12:21.074 --> 00:12:22.951
This is what should be making the headlines.

00:12:36.047 --> 00:12:37.714
Babe, you sure this is right?

00:12:37.715 --> 00:12:39.424
Yeah, you're almost there.

00:12:39.425 --> 00:12:40.592
Okay.

00:12:40.593 --> 00:12:43.679
Now put one hand on your chest. Namaste.

00:12:43.680 --> 00:12:45.055
What? Nama-what-now?

00:12:45.056 --> 00:12:46.556
Namaste.

00:12:46.557 --> 00:12:48.850
Right. Nama…

00:12:48.851 --> 00:12:50.436
FATHER

00:12:51.271 --> 00:12:52.980
- Babe, Father's calling. - What?

00:12:52.981 --> 00:12:54.606
Now? Why?

00:12:54.607 --> 00:12:56.484
- Does he know you're not at work? - Darn it.

00:12:59.404 --> 00:13:00.530
It's not even 8:00 yet.

00:13:01.030 --> 00:13:02.864
That's true. Did you do something wrong?

00:13:02.865 --> 00:13:03.866
No, I didn't.

00:13:04.409 --> 00:13:05.410
Hello, Father.

00:13:06.327 --> 00:13:08.454
What? Seong Huiju did?

00:13:09.122 --> 00:13:11.207
What in the… Babe, turn the TV on.

00:13:13.376 --> 00:13:14.377
Yes.

00:13:15.169 --> 00:13:19.256
Last night, a traffic accident occurred on an outlying road in Gyeonggi Province.

00:13:19.257 --> 00:13:21.258
- A speeding sports car - Yes, just a moment.

00:13:21.259 --> 00:13:23.677
collided with a vehicle in the adjacent lane.

00:13:23.678 --> 00:13:26.430
The driver of the sports car was identified as CEO Seong Huiju

00:13:26.431 --> 00:13:28.974
of Castle Beauty, sparking further controversy.

00:13:28.975 --> 00:13:31.184
It is being reported that Ms. Seong's vehicle

00:13:31.185 --> 00:13:33.145
was traveling 50 km/h over the speed limit…

00:13:33.146 --> 00:13:35.480
- What do we do? - Father, we'll come to you now.

00:13:35.481 --> 00:13:38.234
- The police are still investigating… - All right.

00:13:38.901 --> 00:13:39.944
You can't come in here.

00:13:40.653 --> 00:13:43.071
Seriously? Don't you remember me from last time?

00:13:43.072 --> 00:13:44.823
I'm her assistant at Castle Beauty.

00:13:44.824 --> 00:13:46.450
You can't. Please step back.

00:13:46.451 --> 00:13:48.244
This is driving me insane.

00:13:49.287 --> 00:13:50.329
Then what about him?

00:13:53.041 --> 00:13:56.044
Come on! Why do you only ever stop me?

00:13:56.878 --> 00:13:58.170
Ms. Seong!

00:13:58.171 --> 00:13:59.881
Ms. Do, come here.

00:14:01.507 --> 00:14:02.675
She's with me.

00:14:03.885 --> 00:14:05.678
Those jerks are the worst.

00:14:07.138 --> 00:14:08.139
Unbelievable.

00:14:09.348 --> 00:14:10.391
Why do they keep…

00:14:12.852 --> 00:14:15.354
I told you I'm fine.

00:14:15.897 --> 00:14:17.272
Nothing to worry about.

00:14:17.273 --> 00:14:19.233
I'm totally fine.

00:14:19.984 --> 00:14:21.194
You'll fix this, right?

00:14:25.239 --> 00:14:26.782
LIVE 3-MIN CHART

00:14:26.783 --> 00:14:28.950
This was all part of the plan, right?

00:14:28.951 --> 00:14:32.246
The chairman is freaking out. He wants you as soon as you're discharged.

00:14:34.415 --> 00:14:35.582
He knows I was injured?

00:14:35.583 --> 00:14:36.834
Of course…

00:14:40.755 --> 00:14:42.297
he does.

00:14:42.298 --> 00:14:44.092
And still, not a single word?

00:14:44.926 --> 00:14:46.803
Not from Father, or even Seong Taeju?

00:14:49.305 --> 00:14:51.807
I mean, how did you even end up in that accident?

00:14:54.018 --> 00:14:55.977
- Did you drink and drive? - No, I didn't.

00:14:55.978 --> 00:14:57.021
I swear I didn't.

00:14:58.147 --> 00:15:01.483
Then were you just speeding for the thrill of it?

00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:04.486
You think I'm some kind of lunatic?

00:15:04.487 --> 00:15:06.697
Just randomly speeding for the thrill of it?

00:15:08.407 --> 00:15:09.951
The car just took off.

00:15:10.868 --> 00:15:12.662
The brakes and all weren't working.

00:15:14.080 --> 00:15:15.081
What in the world…

00:15:16.666 --> 00:15:20.253
Then I'll first prepare a press release with the dashcam footage.

00:15:20.837 --> 00:15:22.879
- You can't. - Why not?

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:24.715
You just can't.

00:15:28.261 --> 00:15:29.846
His Majesty was with me.

00:15:30.513 --> 00:15:31.514
His Majesty?

00:15:32.515 --> 00:15:33.933
As in His Majesty the King?

00:15:35.643 --> 00:15:37.520
The investigation won't be public.

00:15:43.484 --> 00:15:44.568
Damn it.

00:15:44.569 --> 00:15:45.903
It just never ends!

00:15:50.241 --> 00:15:51.450
Let's reconsider this.

00:15:52.451 --> 00:15:54.452
- Reconsider what? - This marriage.

00:15:54.453 --> 00:15:55.663
Can't you just call it off?

00:15:56.372 --> 00:15:59.457
You're seriously bringing that up now? :cue

00:15:59.458 --> 00:16:02.752
There has been nothing but trouble since Prince I-AN entered your life.

00:16:02.753 --> 00:16:05.046
Egged at your own door over a little scandal.

00:16:05.047 --> 00:16:07.716
One wrong turn in the palace made you an arsonist.

00:16:07.717 --> 00:16:10.302
And this time, you nearly died.

00:16:10.303 --> 00:16:12.596
Grand Prince I-AN was the one who saved me.

00:16:12.597 --> 00:16:14.307
Wait, he was the one who saved you?

00:16:15.266 --> 00:16:17.310
Why are you two so caught up in this?

00:16:18.019 --> 00:16:19.311
What do you mean?

00:16:19.312 --> 00:16:21.938
I mean, why are you two overdoing it?

00:16:21.939 --> 00:16:23.815
You'll be divorced in three years anyway.

00:16:23.816 --> 00:16:25.025
"Divorced"?

00:16:27.737 --> 00:16:28.738
Jeongwoo.

00:16:48.216 --> 00:16:49.508
Where did you pop out from?

00:16:50.134 --> 00:16:51.677
Is your job fun?

00:16:52.511 --> 00:16:53.803
Pardon?

00:16:53.804 --> 00:16:55.139
Working at the palace.

00:16:55.765 --> 00:16:56.849
Oh, the palace?

00:16:57.683 --> 00:16:58.684
Well…

00:16:59.185 --> 00:17:01.604
Why? Are you looking to work there too?

00:17:02.730 --> 00:17:03.731
Wow.

00:17:05.942 --> 00:17:07.568
When Ms. Seong moves into the palace…

00:17:12.198 --> 00:17:13.407
I'll be following her.

00:17:21.457 --> 00:17:22.625
So charismatic.

00:17:34.387 --> 00:17:35.638
You said it was genuine.

00:17:36.264 --> 00:17:37.681
Was it all a lie?

00:17:37.682 --> 00:17:40.475
I wouldn't go so far as to call it a lie…

00:17:40.476 --> 00:17:42.227
Seong Huiju.

00:17:42.228 --> 00:17:43.813
It's like a marriage of convenience.

00:17:44.355 --> 00:17:45.856
A simple exchange of services.

00:17:46.482 --> 00:17:48.400
You know plenty of people like that.

00:17:48.401 --> 00:17:49.943
Don't make a big deal out of it.

00:17:49.944 --> 00:17:51.237
That's completely different.

00:17:51.821 --> 00:17:52.862
How so?

00:17:52.863 --> 00:17:55.241
Don't you know how dangerous the palace can be?

00:17:55.866 --> 00:17:57.785
- Even this accident-- - I'm fine.

00:17:59.203 --> 00:18:01.205
You think I proposed without knowing that?

00:18:01.914 --> 00:18:02.999
You proposed to him?

00:18:04.250 --> 00:18:06.877
Yeah. I was rejected about three times.

00:18:14.719 --> 00:18:15.720
Listen.

00:18:16.304 --> 00:18:18.097
I have everything but status.

00:18:18.598 --> 00:18:20.599
I have the money, talent, and ambition,

00:18:20.600 --> 00:18:22.393
but status is the one thing I don't have.

00:18:22.893 --> 00:18:24.186
If I just had that…

00:18:25.938 --> 00:18:27.897
I mean, why can't I have that too?

00:18:27.898 --> 00:18:28.982
Is that all?

00:18:33.154 --> 00:18:34.989
The reason you want to marry him.

00:18:35.865 --> 00:18:37.283
Is status all there is to it?

00:18:38.909 --> 00:18:40.411
What else could there be?

00:18:53.674 --> 00:18:54.675
Then do it with me.

00:18:56.010 --> 00:18:57.219
Do what?

00:18:58.763 --> 00:19:00.848
Just marry me instead.

00:19:04.143 --> 00:19:05.311
That will not do.

00:19:06.854 --> 00:19:09.523
The Grand Prince, who had surgery, is returning to the palace.

00:19:10.650 --> 00:19:12.359
Then surely, the King should as well.

00:19:12.360 --> 00:19:14.110
But, Your Majesty…

00:19:14.111 --> 00:19:15.945
If the king remains out of sight,

00:19:15.946 --> 00:19:18.616
the people will come to think they do not need one.

00:19:21.452 --> 00:19:22.662
Do you not agree?

00:19:24.789 --> 00:19:26.290
I agree.

00:19:32.421 --> 00:19:35.090
Your Royal Highness, I've been discharged…

00:19:35.091 --> 00:19:36.092
Huh?

00:19:40.221 --> 00:19:41.972
Has he already been discharged? :cue

00:19:48.062 --> 00:19:50.773
Your Royal Highness, Prime Minister Min has arrived.

00:19:53.693 --> 00:19:54.777
Show him in.

00:19:58.823 --> 00:19:59.824
Your Royal Highness.

00:20:01.701 --> 00:20:02.743
You are all dismissed.

00:20:26.976 --> 00:20:28.060
I mean,

00:20:28.602 --> 00:20:32.815
he should at least tell me if he's been discharged.

00:20:33.691 --> 00:20:36.110
Not a great sign for married life.

00:20:37.570 --> 00:20:39.488
He didn't say anything at the hospital?

00:20:39.989 --> 00:20:40.990
When?

00:20:41.532 --> 00:20:43.951
The last time I saw him was early this morning.

00:20:44.493 --> 00:20:45.494
What?

00:20:57.423 --> 00:20:59.466
But he was standing outside your room earlier.

00:20:59.467 --> 00:21:02.135
My room? When?

00:21:02.136 --> 00:21:04.054
When Prime Minister Min stopped by.

00:21:05.222 --> 00:21:06.639
Then do it with me.

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:09.017
Just marry me instead.

00:21:17.109 --> 00:21:19.862
Huh?

00:21:21.572 --> 00:21:23.281
So what you're saying is

00:21:23.282 --> 00:21:26.534
Ms. Seong was kicked out by His Royal Highness?

00:21:26.535 --> 00:21:29.497
Well, I mean, it was more like…

00:21:30.289 --> 00:21:31.748
He asked that you return home.

00:21:31.749 --> 00:21:33.875
That's the same thing!

00:21:38.547 --> 00:21:39.714
PRINCE

00:21:39.715 --> 00:21:41.341
Is he kidding me right now?

00:21:49.183 --> 00:21:51.644
Your Ladyship! Wait, Your Ladyship.

00:21:53.604 --> 00:21:54.605
It's fine.

00:21:55.356 --> 00:21:57.233
The master of the house has already spoken.

00:21:58.234 --> 00:21:59.527
It's not that.

00:22:02.154 --> 00:22:03.155
The hopae.

00:22:04.365 --> 00:22:05.533
He would like it returned.

00:22:53.247 --> 00:22:56.417
JUNIOR ALUM

00:23:08.429 --> 00:23:09.430
Is that all?

00:23:11.307 --> 00:23:13.350
The reason you want to marry him.

00:23:13.976 --> 00:23:15.269
Is status all there is to it?

00:23:15.811 --> 00:23:16.979
What else could there be?

00:23:17.730 --> 00:23:18.981
Then do it with me.

00:23:20.357 --> 00:23:22.484
Just marry me instead. :cue

00:23:41.879 --> 00:23:43.255
Say it to my face.

00:23:44.173 --> 00:23:45.174
Whatever it is.

00:24:20.709 --> 00:24:24.421
It is a relief that I will never have to teach you.

00:24:28.801 --> 00:24:30.970
No matter how great a teacher may be,

00:24:31.470 --> 00:24:34.974
there are things that simply cannot be taught.

00:24:39.353 --> 00:24:40.521
Pardon?

00:24:51.824 --> 00:24:55.244
Your Royal Highness, Ms. Seong Huiju has arrived.

00:24:57.079 --> 00:24:58.622
Are you cleared to be out already?

00:25:01.917 --> 00:25:02.918
That's your concern?

00:25:08.632 --> 00:25:10.217
Why did you kick me out?

00:25:11.260 --> 00:25:12.553
Because of the Queen Mother?

00:25:16.890 --> 00:25:17.891
Or…

00:25:18.976 --> 00:25:20.102
because of Jeongwoo?

00:25:21.729 --> 00:25:22.730
What about him?

00:25:25.232 --> 00:25:26.983
Didn't you overhear something?

00:25:26.984 --> 00:25:28.068
What?

00:25:29.236 --> 00:25:30.237
Never mind.

00:25:31.947 --> 00:25:34.157
Then why did you kick me out?

00:25:34.158 --> 00:25:36.869
I need to know what's going on before I play along or not.

00:25:39.621 --> 00:25:41.206
Someone messed with your car.

00:25:42.541 --> 00:25:44.001
That is what caused the accident.

00:25:47.880 --> 00:25:49.006
Who?

00:25:49.673 --> 00:25:50.716
It's being investigated.

00:25:51.759 --> 00:25:52.885
We will catch them.

00:25:55.345 --> 00:25:56.346
And so,

00:25:57.890 --> 00:25:59.348
I'm changing the plan.

00:26:02.770 --> 00:26:03.771
Let's…

00:26:08.025 --> 00:26:09.068
call off this marriage.

00:26:14.782 --> 00:26:16.992
What… What was that?

00:26:19.411 --> 00:26:21.497
Call what off now?

00:26:23.332 --> 00:26:24.333
The marriage.

00:26:26.919 --> 00:26:28.128
But why?

00:26:28.879 --> 00:26:30.588
Did Queen Mother tell you to do that?

00:26:30.589 --> 00:26:32.256
Because of the accident?

00:26:32.257 --> 00:26:34.384
That was because His Majesty was relentless.

00:26:35.010 --> 00:26:37.386
And you said someone messed with my car.

00:26:37.387 --> 00:26:39.430
That makes me a victim too.

00:26:39.431 --> 00:26:40.432
Exactly.

00:26:42.184 --> 00:26:43.560
That's why we must call it off.

00:26:47.064 --> 00:26:49.024
If I married someone like you

00:26:49.900 --> 00:26:52.152
who breaks every rule and has enemies at every turn…

00:26:54.655 --> 00:26:56.532
the Crown is bound to fall.

00:27:15.384 --> 00:27:19.011
Father, this is a serious accident. :cue

00:27:19.012 --> 00:27:20.429
See here.

00:27:20.430 --> 00:27:23.224
God, she's even driving on the other side of the road.

00:27:23.225 --> 00:27:25.518
If you ask me, at best, she's drunk.

00:27:25.519 --> 00:27:27.980
At worst, it's hard drugs. Nowadays, there's this…

00:27:29.523 --> 00:27:30.606
Right.

00:27:30.607 --> 00:27:33.651
I mean, she's always been desperate for attention.

00:27:33.652 --> 00:27:37.280
Now that she's dating Prince I-AN, she's become a total hot tomato.

00:27:37.281 --> 00:27:38.323
- And… - Potato.

00:27:39.491 --> 00:27:41.868
It's "hot potato." Like a freshly baked hot potato.

00:27:41.869 --> 00:27:43.287
Oh, right. Potato.

00:27:43.787 --> 00:27:44.913
So, now…

00:27:45.497 --> 00:27:46.956
Babe, does that matter?

00:27:46.957 --> 00:27:48.750
Tomato. Potato. Same difference.

00:27:49.293 --> 00:27:50.377
Sometimes, you can be…

00:27:51.086 --> 00:27:56.132
Anyway, Father, this is totally a huge, glaring owner-related risk.

00:27:56.133 --> 00:27:58.634
You saw how the stock had shot up over the last few days

00:27:58.635 --> 00:28:00.428
and just took a nosedive, didn't you?

00:28:00.429 --> 00:28:02.639
At this rate, Castle Beauty will just…

00:28:04.057 --> 00:28:05.309
So what?

00:28:08.228 --> 00:28:09.854
You want to take over Beauty?

00:28:09.855 --> 00:28:11.899
Is that any way to speak to your brother?

00:28:12.524 --> 00:28:14.275
What is it?

00:28:14.276 --> 00:28:16.111
Let's make this quick. I'm busy.

00:28:18.530 --> 00:28:19.865
Explain yourself.

00:28:22.075 --> 00:28:23.869
What is there to explain?

00:28:24.828 --> 00:28:26.203
It's just as you see.

00:28:26.204 --> 00:28:27.789
Can you handle the consequences?

00:28:28.290 --> 00:28:29.958
We'll issue a press release soon.

00:28:31.335 --> 00:28:32.336
Neither alcohol

00:28:33.253 --> 00:28:34.837
nor drugs were involved.

00:28:34.838 --> 00:28:36.798
I heard they moved all your things

00:28:37.591 --> 00:28:39.092
out of his house today.

00:28:39.760 --> 00:28:41.677
Did you have me followed?

00:28:41.678 --> 00:28:43.346
Explain yourself first!

00:28:46.975 --> 00:28:48.769
It's just a lovers' spat.

00:28:50.062 --> 00:28:51.145
Satisfied?

00:28:51.146 --> 00:28:52.730
You call yourself a businesswoman,

00:28:52.731 --> 00:28:54.899
yet you don't even realize you're being used.

00:28:54.900 --> 00:28:57.277
The Grand Prince has used you for all you're worth.

00:28:58.695 --> 00:29:02.240
He acted like he was above status, as if he had no ambition for the throne.

00:29:03.033 --> 00:29:04.993
Now that he has everything…

00:29:07.996 --> 00:29:09.497
he's tossing you out.

00:29:12.376 --> 00:29:13.377
So what?

00:29:15.170 --> 00:29:16.463
What's the issue?

00:29:18.423 --> 00:29:20.008
Two can play that game.

00:29:21.551 --> 00:29:24.221
Do you know how much our stock has jumped at the news

00:29:25.013 --> 00:29:27.515
of Castle Group's Seong Huiju marrying into the royal family?

00:29:27.516 --> 00:29:30.309
Hey, kid. It all tanked today.

00:29:30.310 --> 00:29:32.729
It will bounce right back after the press release, damn it.

00:29:36.984 --> 00:29:39.987
They're even asking if the "Castle" name was part of some grand plan.

00:29:40.654 --> 00:29:41.737
Haven't you seen the news?

00:29:41.738 --> 00:29:44.615
Did it ever cross your mind that it'll put a bigger target on our backs?

00:29:44.616 --> 00:29:46.201
So we take a few hits!

00:29:48.078 --> 00:29:49.662
A few hits won't kill you.

00:29:53.417 --> 00:29:55.293
And even if it did, what of it?

00:29:56.795 --> 00:29:58.255
We all end up dead anyway.

00:29:59.047 --> 00:30:01.091
What, do you plan to live forever?

00:30:02.384 --> 00:30:04.428
Next time, just text me instead.

00:30:05.679 --> 00:30:08.682
If you want to yell that badly, then feel free to call.

00:30:12.144 --> 00:30:14.103
- Sit down. - I have plans.

00:30:14.104 --> 00:30:15.105
Seong Huiju!

00:30:19.109 --> 00:30:20.110
It's me.

00:30:20.652 --> 00:30:22.529
I need you to look into something for me.

00:30:33.790 --> 00:30:35.417
Find out who last worked on my car.

00:30:37.669 --> 00:30:41.298
Dig up everything you possibly can on them. :cue

00:30:47.387 --> 00:30:49.139
A grand prince of this nation can't…

00:30:50.766 --> 00:30:52.726
break an engagement.

00:30:53.268 --> 00:30:56.604
Technically, there's nothing to break. We were never engaged.

00:30:56.605 --> 00:30:57.688
Are you kidding?

00:30:57.689 --> 00:31:00.733
After all that talk about getting married and living together?

00:31:00.734 --> 00:31:01.984
We never lived together.

00:31:01.985 --> 00:31:04.071
- I was at the palace, and she was-- - Listen.

00:31:06.156 --> 00:31:09.533
Even if you killed someone, I would take your side.

00:31:09.534 --> 00:31:10.869
But this is not cool. It's--

00:31:12.037 --> 00:31:13.914
Why would you side with a murderer?

00:31:15.332 --> 00:31:17.209
You must've had your reasons.

00:31:18.126 --> 00:31:20.211
So, why did you break it off?

00:31:20.212 --> 00:31:22.297
- I didn't "break"-- - Seriously? Come on.

00:31:23.090 --> 00:31:24.299
That's not what I'm asking.

00:31:27.135 --> 00:31:29.012
Why did you break it off?

00:31:39.356 --> 00:31:40.357
To keep her alive.

00:31:43.568 --> 00:31:46.821
Mother, should we pick up fried chicken on the way to the palace?

00:31:46.822 --> 00:31:47.905
Fried chicken?

00:31:47.906 --> 00:31:50.200
Hwan texted and said he wanted some.

00:31:51.701 --> 00:31:53.786
He's always making me do stuff like this.

00:31:53.787 --> 00:31:56.248
Shall we, then?

00:31:56.873 --> 00:31:57.874
Yes, Mother.

00:32:24.317 --> 00:32:25.735
Mother!

00:32:55.390 --> 00:32:58.268
Mother, should we pick up fried chicken on the way to the palace?

00:33:00.145 --> 00:33:01.396
Shall we, then?

00:33:08.904 --> 00:33:10.447
Mother…

00:33:11.615 --> 00:33:12.824
Mother…

00:33:48.485 --> 00:33:50.111
There wasn't a doubt in my mind.

00:33:50.779 --> 00:33:53.657
It was a moment I'd regretted countless times.

00:34:09.297 --> 00:34:10.590
That's what changed my mind.

00:34:13.009 --> 00:34:14.261
It was just an accident.

00:34:15.178 --> 00:34:17.347
It wasn't even your fault, so why?

00:34:20.058 --> 00:34:21.101
It was my fault.

00:34:23.228 --> 00:34:24.521
Signs of deliberate tampering

00:34:25.105 --> 00:34:26.815
were found in the accident vehicle.

00:34:28.233 --> 00:34:31.736
We'll need to investigate further to determine if they were targeting

00:34:32.279 --> 00:34:33.738
His Majesty or Ms. Seong.

00:34:38.076 --> 00:34:40.704
However, do not concern yourself too much. :cue

00:34:42.664 --> 00:34:44.581
I will do everything in my power to protect

00:34:44.582 --> 00:34:46.042
His Majesty, Your Royal Highness,

00:34:47.335 --> 00:34:48.503
and the Crown.

00:34:52.132 --> 00:34:53.133
In turn,

00:34:53.758 --> 00:34:54.843
I'd like to ask you

00:34:56.720 --> 00:34:59.139
to protect Ms. Seong Huiju.

00:35:01.433 --> 00:35:03.518
Please cast her far away from the palace.

00:35:05.312 --> 00:35:08.064
I sincerely implore you, Your Royal Highness.

00:35:13.820 --> 00:35:14.946
That is why

00:35:16.197 --> 00:35:17.324
I must step aside.

00:35:19.409 --> 00:35:20.410
Your Royal Highness.

00:35:20.952 --> 00:35:22.037
Thus,

00:35:23.580 --> 00:35:24.623
I want to do something.

00:35:25.832 --> 00:35:26.833
Pardon?

00:35:28.501 --> 00:35:29.502
A parting gift.

00:35:31.296 --> 00:35:32.297
For her.

00:35:43.725 --> 00:35:45.392
The Inner Court Banquet guest list,

00:35:45.393 --> 00:35:47.061
proposed by the Royal Secretariat.

00:35:47.062 --> 00:35:49.438
PALACE EVENT HOSTED FOR LADIES OF THE INNER COURT

00:35:49.439 --> 00:35:51.316
TRADITIONALLY HELD SINCE THE JOSEON DYNASTY

00:35:53.360 --> 00:35:55.695
Remove the scandal-ridden figures.

00:35:59.491 --> 00:36:00.700
No new money either.

00:36:03.119 --> 00:36:05.329
The merits of these two are comparable.

00:36:05.330 --> 00:36:07.331
Bring me the details of their families.

00:36:07.332 --> 00:36:08.666
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:36:08.667 --> 00:36:10.585
Your standards rise every year.

00:36:11.461 --> 00:36:14.880
The more exclusive the guest list,

00:36:14.881 --> 00:36:17.759
the deeper the despair of the uninvited.

00:36:18.802 --> 00:36:22.347
And with it comes the greater delight of those invited.

00:36:23.390 --> 00:36:24.808
INNER COURT BANQUET GUEST LIST

00:36:27.727 --> 00:36:30.062
Another gathering of the usual suspects this year.

00:36:30.063 --> 00:36:31.230
All nobility.

00:36:31.231 --> 00:36:32.816
The competition is fiercer every year.

00:36:33.441 --> 00:36:35.234
It does offer many benefits.

00:36:35.235 --> 00:36:36.694
That is true.

00:36:36.695 --> 00:36:38.696
But if they managed to secure an invite,

00:36:38.697 --> 00:36:41.532
they must already possess plenty of money and land.

00:36:43.785 --> 00:36:46.579
That's precisely why they're willing to die for royal prestige.

00:36:47.247 --> 00:36:49.290
It's the only thing their money can't buy.

00:36:54.170 --> 00:36:55.462
Ma'am.

00:36:55.463 --> 00:36:58.257
I had to jump through some pretty high hoops to secure

00:36:58.258 --> 00:37:00.509
this Inner Court Banquet guest list.

00:37:00.510 --> 00:37:02.177
A lot of familiar faces, right?

00:37:02.178 --> 00:37:04.680
A gathering of female business leaders in their thirties…

00:37:04.681 --> 00:37:06.598
Still just 20 of them, right?

00:37:06.599 --> 00:37:09.101
Not even enough for a soccer match.

00:37:09.102 --> 00:37:10.728
But, ma'am, you said so yourself.

00:37:10.729 --> 00:37:13.230
"One absolute is worth more than a hundred maybes."

00:37:13.231 --> 00:37:14.857
These are 20 absolutes.

00:37:14.858 --> 00:37:16.609
All backed by the Crown, no less!

00:37:20.697 --> 00:37:23.532
You once called this the most luxurious marketing strategy…

00:37:23.533 --> 00:37:25.576
So what's your point?

00:37:25.577 --> 00:37:27.119
Moving on.

00:37:27.120 --> 00:37:30.122
Since you have ties with the palace and all, we thought

00:37:30.123 --> 00:37:32.791
one of the guests could be a new face of our luxury line.

00:37:32.792 --> 00:37:33.752
Yes, so we…

00:37:34.252 --> 00:37:35.837
Just a moment. Oh.

00:37:40.550 --> 00:37:41.843
Hello.

00:37:42.594 --> 00:37:43.595
Hello.

00:37:44.804 --> 00:37:47.890
MS. SEONG HUIJU, YOU ARE CORDIALLY INVITED TO THE INNER COURT BANQUET

00:37:49.184 --> 00:37:50.642
Me?

00:37:50.643 --> 00:37:51.978
Yes, Ms. Seong.

00:37:53.688 --> 00:37:58.192
The Inner Court Banquet is a very important annual event.

00:37:58.193 --> 00:38:00.737
Of course, I'm aware of the Inner Court Banquet.

00:38:01.696 --> 00:38:05.908
But I thought only noblewomen were invited to this.

00:38:05.909 --> 00:38:08.535
What? No such criterion exists…

00:38:08.536 --> 00:38:09.912
It certainly doesn't,

00:38:09.913 --> 00:38:11.289
but that's how it's been done.

00:38:12.123 --> 00:38:14.334
For 600 years, without a single exception.

00:38:18.505 --> 00:38:21.882
The thing about change is that it happens gradually…

00:38:21.883 --> 00:38:23.050
So? How? Why?

00:38:23.051 --> 00:38:26.262
Why have I suddenly been invited?

00:38:26.763 --> 00:38:30.349
Yes, well, you've experienced some hardships recently,

00:38:30.350 --> 00:38:33.853
and the press release about your breakup is about to go out.

00:38:34.354 --> 00:38:37.689
So to make it clear the palace wasn't responsible for your breakup…

00:38:37.690 --> 00:38:40.526
You want to stage a performance for the public? :cue

00:38:49.702 --> 00:38:51.161
Yes, you see,

00:38:51.162 --> 00:38:53.455
the dress codes for the two parts are different.

00:38:53.456 --> 00:38:55.707
It's customary to wear a dangui for the reception.

00:38:55.708 --> 00:38:59.169
The Queen Mother will wear white, so it's best to avoid that color.

00:38:59.170 --> 00:39:00.838
No thanks.

00:39:00.839 --> 00:39:03.216
To what exactly? The dangui?

00:39:04.425 --> 00:39:06.177
The Inner Court Banquet.

00:39:09.097 --> 00:39:10.305
Ms. Seong.

00:39:10.306 --> 00:39:11.557
Why?

00:39:11.558 --> 00:39:13.685
The Inner Court Banquet? You don't want to attend?

00:39:15.603 --> 00:39:18.438
Silly me, how did I forget to mention this?

00:39:18.439 --> 00:39:22.818
Attending it once will lead to many more royal invitations.

00:39:22.819 --> 00:39:25.487
Even royal patronage for your overseas business.

00:39:25.488 --> 00:39:27.073
Okay. Above all else,

00:39:27.574 --> 00:39:31.118
this will confirm that you two didn't end things badly,

00:39:31.119 --> 00:39:33.912
and that you remain on good terms with the Crown.

00:39:33.913 --> 00:39:36.164
We can pivot to an "it's all cool" narrative--

00:39:36.165 --> 00:39:37.791
- That would be excellent. - Mm-hmm.

00:39:37.792 --> 00:39:39.334
You've always wanted an invite.

00:39:39.335 --> 00:39:42.130
That was before marriage was on the table.

00:39:43.548 --> 00:39:44.882
No thanks.

00:39:44.883 --> 00:39:47.801
But still, His Royal Highness personally…

00:39:47.802 --> 00:39:48.970
No…

00:39:49.762 --> 00:39:51.055
thank…

00:39:53.224 --> 00:39:54.225
you.

00:39:56.185 --> 00:39:57.352
What?

00:39:57.353 --> 00:39:59.354
So? You just left?

00:39:59.355 --> 00:40:03.443
What choice did I have? She was about to murder me in broad daylight.

00:40:08.197 --> 00:40:10.783
I heard you moved Seong Huiju out of your private residence.

00:40:12.952 --> 00:40:14.329
What are you playing at?

00:40:15.872 --> 00:40:17.123
I am protecting her.

00:40:18.499 --> 00:40:19.792
Her ties to the Crown

00:40:20.835 --> 00:40:22.377
have only led her to misfortune.

00:40:22.378 --> 00:40:23.588
Then,

00:40:24.672 --> 00:40:26.758
ensure she no longer has any ties to the Crown.

00:40:27.759 --> 00:40:28.843
That is my intention.

00:40:32.931 --> 00:40:33.973
I will not pursue

00:40:35.475 --> 00:40:36.684
marriage with Seong Huiju.

00:40:37.810 --> 00:40:38.811
In turn,

00:40:39.312 --> 00:40:41.439
I ask that you invite her to the Inner Court Banquet.

00:40:42.649 --> 00:40:44.025
I do not wish to see her suffer

00:40:44.776 --> 00:40:46.235
because of our parting.

00:40:51.991 --> 00:40:53.117
Summon her to the palace.

00:40:54.035 --> 00:40:55.286
Ms. Seong Huiju?

00:40:55.787 --> 00:40:56.788
You want me to?

00:40:58.373 --> 00:41:01.376
I shall persuade her myself.

00:41:02.502 --> 00:41:03.544
No thanks.

00:41:05.296 --> 00:41:06.589
No, thank you.

00:41:07.966 --> 00:41:09.467
Who is he to summon me?

00:41:13.137 --> 00:41:14.889
Is the fried chicken here?

00:41:15.640 --> 00:41:18.184
What? You ordered fried chicken again?

00:41:21.646 --> 00:41:23.022
You open it.

00:41:31.614 --> 00:41:32.740
Mmm.

00:41:33.324 --> 00:41:35.742
People have nothing on fried chicken, right?

00:41:35.743 --> 00:41:37.828
It shows up right on time when you call them.

00:41:37.829 --> 00:41:39.455
You never get sick of it.

00:41:39.998 --> 00:41:41.207
Always so reliable.

00:41:42.667 --> 00:41:43.876
- Wait… - What?

00:41:44.502 --> 00:41:46.254
Are you upset you got dumped?

00:41:48.506 --> 00:41:50.883
Why would you say that when I'm enjoying fried chicken?

00:41:51.426 --> 00:41:52.427
I'm done.

00:41:54.512 --> 00:41:56.514
Oh, I mean…

00:41:58.057 --> 00:42:00.810
Why are you so upset?

00:42:01.310 --> 00:42:03.104
It was all pretend.

00:42:04.272 --> 00:42:06.649
That's exactly why.

00:42:08.192 --> 00:42:10.402
Relationships end when one side loses interest,

00:42:10.403 --> 00:42:11.945
whether the other likes it or not.

00:42:11.946 --> 00:42:13.572
But that's not what this was.

00:42:13.573 --> 00:42:15.408
This was strictly a contract.

00:42:17.410 --> 00:42:18.786
Father was right.

00:42:19.620 --> 00:42:23.124
I'm a businesswoman. I should've known better than to trust a stranger.

00:42:24.042 --> 00:42:25.710
I should've drawn up a contract. :cue

00:42:37.597 --> 00:42:38.722
Ms. Seong, the invite--

00:42:38.723 --> 00:42:39.974
No thanks.

00:42:40.558 --> 00:42:41.559
Ms. Seong.

00:42:42.101 --> 00:42:43.185
No thanks.

00:42:43.186 --> 00:42:46.189
-  You're really not going? - No, thank you!

00:42:51.402 --> 00:42:52.569
Is she dumb?

00:42:52.570 --> 00:42:54.738
Just give up already.

00:42:54.739 --> 00:42:56.656
She doesn't want anything to do with you.

00:42:56.657 --> 00:42:57.950
Choi Hyeon.

00:43:00.745 --> 00:43:02.205
I mean, I can't blame her.

00:43:02.705 --> 00:43:05.041
You dumped her and now you're acting so uncool.

00:43:11.756 --> 00:43:13.131
Hey, Ms. Seong.

00:43:13.132 --> 00:43:15.300
I went to the repair shop and secured

00:43:15.301 --> 00:43:18.054
the résumé of the bastard who tampered with your car and fled.

00:43:18.763 --> 00:43:21.181
They ran a search with his photo,

00:43:21.182 --> 00:43:23.684
but he doesn't seem to have any priors.

00:43:24.477 --> 00:43:28.231
He must've bought something there at least once.

00:43:28.815 --> 00:43:29.816
What?

00:43:30.441 --> 00:43:32.568
There's a convenience store in front of the shop.

00:43:33.444 --> 00:43:34.903
Oh, right.

00:43:34.904 --> 00:43:37.239
Scour their CCTV footage.

00:43:37.240 --> 00:43:38.991
I want his purchase history.

00:43:47.333 --> 00:43:48.417
Say it to my face.

00:43:49.418 --> 00:43:50.419
Whatever it is.

00:44:09.647 --> 00:44:11.232
Are you afraid to go to the banquet?

00:44:14.360 --> 00:44:16.445
I will prepare everything you need.

00:44:17.738 --> 00:44:18.823
From the clothes

00:44:19.490 --> 00:44:20.907
to the etiquette lessons.

00:44:20.908 --> 00:44:22.201
Why?

00:44:23.035 --> 00:44:26.956
I break every rule and have enemies at every turn.

00:44:27.957 --> 00:44:29.749
- So why would I go there? - Seong Huiju.

00:44:29.750 --> 00:44:31.794
Then provide me with a convincing reason.

00:44:33.171 --> 00:44:36.089
You risked your life to save me, just to break off the engagement.

00:44:36.090 --> 00:44:38.593
And now you're inviting me to the Inner Court Banquet?

00:44:39.552 --> 00:44:40.802
A split personality?

00:44:40.803 --> 00:44:42.221
I am trying to protect you!

00:44:44.223 --> 00:44:45.391
We're not even married…

00:44:47.977 --> 00:44:49.729
and you've been attacked multiple times.

00:44:51.272 --> 00:44:52.815
And once the breakup news breaks,

00:44:54.734 --> 00:44:56.152
it'll only get worse.

00:44:57.028 --> 00:44:58.029
So what?

00:44:59.363 --> 00:45:02.575
"Social ascent is dangerous. Be content with an invite to the banquet."

00:45:03.492 --> 00:45:05.745
- Is that it? - Just stay out of harm's way.

00:45:07.413 --> 00:45:08.581
Is that so difficult?

00:45:11.918 --> 00:45:12.919
Coward.

00:45:15.129 --> 00:45:16.338
What?

00:45:29.435 --> 00:45:31.312
- What are you… - You like cats.

00:45:33.147 --> 00:45:34.148
Try protecting them.

00:45:35.149 --> 00:45:36.442
I'm going to attack them.

00:45:45.701 --> 00:45:47.245
What the hell are you doing?

00:45:56.712 --> 00:45:58.422
This is how you protect someone.

00:45:59.882 --> 00:46:00.967
You go on the offensive.

00:46:01.926 --> 00:46:03.219
You fight back.

00:46:15.523 --> 00:46:17.440
You never learned to bend.

00:46:17.441 --> 00:46:20.653
You only know how to bend. That's why you lose to people beneath you.

00:46:22.238 --> 00:46:23.781
I asked you for status,

00:46:24.740 --> 00:46:27.034
not a cozy cradle to hide from the world.

00:46:31.330 --> 00:46:32.540
Do not bend to their will. :cue

00:46:33.874 --> 00:46:35.167
Do not back away

00:46:36.794 --> 00:46:38.129
and do not compromise.

00:46:41.549 --> 00:46:43.175
That's how you and I both

00:46:44.719 --> 00:46:46.053
get what we want.

00:46:57.773 --> 00:46:59.150
She is one scary lady.

00:47:00.609 --> 00:47:03.236
I know all's fair in love and war,

00:47:03.237 --> 00:47:04.863
but isn't this taking it too far?

00:47:04.864 --> 00:47:06.740
Is a "safe exit" an option here?

00:47:06.741 --> 00:47:08.658
I told you I hurt myself.

00:47:08.659 --> 00:47:11.870
Even so, how could she let your precious body be injured?

00:47:11.871 --> 00:47:13.538
She has crossed the line.

00:47:13.539 --> 00:47:14.540
I told you she didn't.

00:47:19.462 --> 00:47:21.213
She never released the arrow.

00:47:22.965 --> 00:47:24.132
What?

00:47:40.024 --> 00:47:41.233
She never crossed the line.

00:47:46.989 --> 00:47:50.784
My eyes are fried.

00:47:50.785 --> 00:47:52.369
He must've been super diligent.

00:47:52.370 --> 00:47:55.413
Never going to the convenience store across the street.

00:47:55.414 --> 00:47:56.540
My thoughts exactly.

00:47:57.833 --> 00:47:59.085
Wait.

00:47:59.668 --> 00:48:00.920
I think this is him.

00:48:01.670 --> 00:48:02.754
Take a look at this.

00:48:04.924 --> 00:48:06.967
- It's him, right? -  Yeah, it is.

00:48:14.433 --> 00:48:15.518
Castle Pay!

00:48:17.395 --> 00:48:19.020
- Yeah, he used Castle Pay! - He did.

00:48:19.021 --> 00:48:20.772
Good job!

00:48:20.773 --> 00:48:21.981
Hold on.

00:48:21.982 --> 00:48:26.237
But the CEO of Castle Card is Senior Managing Director Seong, isn't it?

00:48:28.781 --> 00:48:30.824
Let me get this straight.

00:48:30.825 --> 00:48:34.703
You need help from your dear brother.

00:48:35.746 --> 00:48:37.581
Yes.

00:48:41.419 --> 00:48:42.461
I mean, sure.

00:48:44.171 --> 00:48:45.755
I could do that for you, but--

00:48:45.756 --> 00:48:47.049
Who is he anyway?

00:48:48.217 --> 00:48:49.677
He's trying to kill me.

00:48:52.930 --> 00:48:53.931
This kid…

00:48:54.473 --> 00:48:57.142
Do you take me for a sucker?

00:48:57.143 --> 00:48:58.185
Are you serious?

00:49:01.439 --> 00:49:03.399
So show me what you can do.

00:49:04.400 --> 00:49:06.359
I want some vigilante justice.

00:49:06.360 --> 00:49:07.570
This kid…

00:49:08.988 --> 00:49:10.406
Who is this guy anyway?

00:49:30.468 --> 00:49:31.677
Then do it with me.

00:49:32.887 --> 00:49:34.930
Just marry me instead.

00:49:45.774 --> 00:49:47.943
Why would I marry you?

00:49:54.450 --> 00:49:55.534
Why not?

00:49:57.161 --> 00:49:58.662
It's not like you have feelings

00:49:59.371 --> 00:50:00.831
for either of us.

00:50:02.416 --> 00:50:03.834
You have a five-year term.

00:50:05.127 --> 00:50:08.463
It doesn't matter if I mess up or divorce him.

00:50:08.464 --> 00:50:10.007
He'll be a royal for life.

00:50:10.633 --> 00:50:11.800
But you're different.

00:50:17.556 --> 00:50:18.933
You should serve another term.

00:50:19.808 --> 00:50:21.101
Pull yourself together. :cue

00:50:53.467 --> 00:50:54.969
Is it weighing on your mind?

00:50:58.889 --> 00:51:00.349
I heard from Aide Choi.

00:51:00.849 --> 00:51:03.352
That there was an argument at your private residence.

00:51:04.770 --> 00:51:06.772
Choi Hyeon…

00:51:07.565 --> 00:51:09.065
He can be quite the chatterbox.

00:51:09.066 --> 00:51:11.360
Just let her win if you can.

00:51:12.236 --> 00:51:14.113
She is already under the cutting scrutiny

00:51:14.613 --> 00:51:16.155
of the court of public opinion.

00:51:44.643 --> 00:51:47.021
PRINCE

00:51:58.532 --> 00:51:59.533
Hello.

00:52:00.826 --> 00:52:02.328
The invitation has already been sent.

00:52:04.788 --> 00:52:05.956
So you cannot decline.

00:52:13.881 --> 00:52:14.965
It's for your sake.

00:52:17.885 --> 00:52:18.886
I know.

00:52:28.771 --> 00:52:29.813
I'm sorry.

00:52:31.231 --> 00:52:33.817
I never meant to hurt you.

00:52:35.903 --> 00:52:37.363
Or the cat.

00:52:38.781 --> 00:52:39.782
I know.

00:52:44.953 --> 00:52:45.954
I'm sorry too.

00:52:51.085 --> 00:52:52.336
For not keeping my promise.

00:52:59.176 --> 00:53:00.302
As long as you know.

00:53:13.482 --> 00:53:15.943
CASTLE BEAUTY

00:53:24.576 --> 00:53:26.745
I heard you will be attending.

00:53:27.579 --> 00:53:31.666
Yes, well, he just insisted it would be in my best interest.

00:53:33.377 --> 00:53:35.378
There's one thing you should be aware of.

00:53:35.379 --> 00:53:37.256
- Just a moment. - Sure.

00:53:38.090 --> 00:53:39.757
- Please continue. - All right.

00:53:39.758 --> 00:53:43.595
All the other invited guests hold official rank.

00:53:44.179 --> 00:53:47.306
In the royal court, rank defines one's place in the hierarchy.

00:53:47.307 --> 00:53:49.727
- Hierarchy? - Yes. Uh…

00:53:50.310 --> 00:53:54.731
I'm sure you noticed after attending a few royal events.

00:53:54.732 --> 00:53:56.899
When you're with someone of a higher rank,

00:53:56.900 --> 00:54:00.779
you must walk behind them. That's the custom.

00:54:06.118 --> 00:54:07.202
I'll keep that in mind.

00:54:08.912 --> 00:54:10.288
Thank you.

00:54:10.289 --> 00:54:11.457
And there's this.

00:54:12.750 --> 00:54:13.792
Here.

00:54:14.501 --> 00:54:18.254
The first half is a smaller gathering where the Queen Mother

00:54:18.255 --> 00:54:19.589
and the guests mingle.

00:54:19.590 --> 00:54:21.090
The second half is a ball.

00:54:21.091 --> 00:54:22.634
They call it an "after-party,"

00:54:23.218 --> 00:54:27.096
but with the guests' partners, Cabinet members, and royal family members

00:54:27.097 --> 00:54:30.141
all attending, it's larger in scale than the first part.

00:54:30.142 --> 00:54:32.643
I read an article about this while studying abroad.

00:54:32.644 --> 00:54:33.978
You wear gowns and dance…

00:54:33.979 --> 00:54:35.396
That's correct.

00:54:35.397 --> 00:54:38.484
Then what will Ms. Seong's rank be?

00:54:40.903 --> 00:54:43.279
Her rank…

00:54:43.280 --> 00:54:47.825
Ms. Seong is super accomplished and all,

00:54:47.826 --> 00:54:49.411
but she has no official rank.

00:54:50.496 --> 00:54:51.830
- What? - Well…

00:54:52.623 --> 00:54:54.957
She's neither a public official

00:54:54.958 --> 00:54:56.876
nor a noble.

00:54:56.877 --> 00:55:00.755
So Ms. Seong will be sitting at the very back of the room

00:55:00.756 --> 00:55:02.382
and will always be last in line.

00:55:03.008 --> 00:55:07.137
:cue

00:55:11.058 --> 00:55:14.520
I would be in front of the line if I were married, right?

00:55:25.072 --> 00:55:27.323
"The attendees receive honorary decorations

00:55:27.324 --> 00:55:31.077
from the royal family and gain the privilege

00:55:31.078 --> 00:55:34.247
of accompanying the court when it hosts diplomatic events,

00:55:34.248 --> 00:55:36.500
starting with the year they are invited."

00:55:38.085 --> 00:55:42.130
It is a relief that I will never have to teach you.

00:55:45.008 --> 00:55:47.427
As if she'd ever grant me such privileges.

00:55:53.058 --> 00:55:54.560
PRINCE

00:55:57.062 --> 00:55:58.063
Hello?

00:56:00.566 --> 00:56:01.567
Right now?

00:56:12.786 --> 00:56:14.037
What's this about?

00:56:24.172 --> 00:56:25.173
Why not?

00:56:25.674 --> 00:56:27.383
This will be the last time.

00:56:28.760 --> 00:56:32.221
Where did you ever find the nerve to wear that cheollik?

00:56:32.222 --> 00:56:34.349
Was that just a stylistic choice?

00:56:34.891 --> 00:56:36.727
I'm doing all this for your sake…

00:56:52.534 --> 00:56:53.702
What are you doing?

00:56:54.328 --> 00:56:56.288
Don't mind me. Just practicing.

00:56:57.080 --> 00:56:59.708
- Practicing what? - Walking according to rank.

00:57:00.834 --> 00:57:04.462
I'll definitely end up walking ahead that day if I don't practice now.

00:57:04.463 --> 00:57:06.673
Because I'm always a trendsetter, leading the way.

00:57:31.657 --> 00:57:34.743
- A word, please! - Please look over here!

00:57:36.536 --> 00:57:39.706
- Over here! - Give us a pose!

00:57:44.378 --> 00:57:47.464
I trust all the preparations are in order?

00:57:48.090 --> 00:57:49.675
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:58:14.282 --> 00:58:15.575
Bye.

00:58:17.202 --> 00:58:18.203
Wait.

00:58:20.872 --> 00:58:21.873
"Leading the way."

00:58:23.041 --> 00:58:24.209
How do you do it?

00:58:29.005 --> 00:58:30.048
I just never learned.

00:58:31.174 --> 00:58:33.719
I was always the one following behind.

00:58:39.683 --> 00:58:41.184
You just need to walk by my side.

00:58:43.145 --> 00:58:44.271
I'll teach you.

00:59:06.626 --> 00:59:10.296
Now that Dano, when yang energy is said to be at its peak, has passed,

00:59:10.297 --> 00:59:12.715
the Inner Court Banquet has finally commenced.

00:59:12.716 --> 00:59:14.592
It's a gathering of 20 young women

00:59:14.593 --> 00:59:17.595
centered around the Queen Mother, the head of the Inner Court.

00:59:17.596 --> 00:59:20.681
This year's guest list includes Seong Huiju, CEO of Castle Beauty,

00:59:20.682 --> 00:59:22.017
drawing significant attention.

00:59:22.851 --> 00:59:25.019
-  Babe! - You scared me.

00:59:25.020 --> 00:59:26.271
Babe.

00:59:27.647 --> 00:59:29.232
I found the punk who rigged her car.

00:59:30.484 --> 00:59:31.817
You did?

00:59:31.818 --> 00:59:33.153
Yeah, but…

00:59:33.862 --> 00:59:34.905
But?

00:59:35.822 --> 00:59:36.990
He's dead.

00:59:37.574 --> 00:59:39.326
- What? - He died.

00:59:39.951 --> 00:59:40.952
Yesterday. :cue

00:59:43.163 --> 00:59:45.122
JUNIOR 4TH RANK, SENIOR 4TH RANK

00:59:45.123 --> 00:59:46.665
JUNIOR 5TH RANK

00:59:51.588 --> 00:59:52.671
JUNIOR 6TH RANK

00:59:52.672 --> 00:59:54.173
SEONG HUIJU, COMMONER

00:59:54.174 --> 00:59:56.509
For all her much-touted success abroad,

00:59:56.510 --> 00:59:58.302
she was never invited.

00:59:58.303 --> 01:00:00.346
It seems being the Grand Prince's woman

01:00:00.347 --> 01:00:02.932
outweighs any barrier of status.

01:00:02.933 --> 01:00:05.518
If she successfully marries him, she will be royalty,

01:00:05.519 --> 01:00:07.561
so they must be keeping up appearances.

01:00:07.562 --> 01:00:09.230
Even so,

01:00:09.231 --> 01:00:11.274
is she not someone who caused a public scandal?

01:00:11.900 --> 01:00:13.943
If she had been a guest last year,

01:00:13.944 --> 01:00:16.696
at least they could have used her achievements as an excuse.

01:00:17.656 --> 01:00:20.032
The royal family is such a joke these days.

01:00:22.953 --> 01:00:24.621
- Your Majesty. - Your Majesty.

01:00:25.580 --> 01:00:26.915
SEONG HUIJU, COMMONER

01:00:29.960 --> 01:00:32.336
Were you speaking ill of someone who is not even here?

01:00:32.337 --> 01:00:34.840
Pardon?

01:00:35.423 --> 01:00:36.883
I should have come later.

01:00:37.884 --> 01:00:39.135
Considering you saw fit

01:00:39.886 --> 01:00:41.805
to drag the royal family into your gossip.

01:00:42.597 --> 01:00:44.223
Ms. Seong, over here!

01:00:44.224 --> 01:00:47.059
- Ms. Seong, over here! - Please look here!

01:01:01.908 --> 01:01:03.285
Your Majesty.

01:01:04.327 --> 01:01:05.995
I am Huiju of the Seong Family.

01:01:05.996 --> 01:01:07.496
-  Ms. Seong. -  Ms. Seong!

01:01:07.497 --> 01:01:10.499
How does it feel to be back at the palace since going public?

01:01:10.500 --> 01:01:12.418
What was the palace's stance on the accident?

01:01:12.419 --> 01:01:15.212
Is there a reason why you arrived after Her Majesty?

01:01:15.213 --> 01:01:17.047
-  Please give us a comment! -  Please!

01:01:17.048 --> 01:01:19.091
- We await your response. - Give us a comment.

01:01:19.092 --> 01:01:21.678
Unfortunately, I still do not know my way around the palace.

01:01:22.345 --> 01:01:25.472
I ended up losing my way for a moment.

01:01:30.437 --> 01:01:32.230
Please forgive me,

01:01:32.939 --> 01:01:33.982
Your Majesty.

01:01:42.407 --> 01:01:45.035
I was told the Royal Secretariat provided you with guidance.

01:01:46.202 --> 01:01:48.705
Did you avoid wearing a dangui for some particular reason?

01:01:49.664 --> 01:01:50.749
Ah!

01:01:51.583 --> 01:01:55.086
I was led to believe that custom was not mandatory.

01:01:58.423 --> 01:02:00.257
Is it not to your liking?

01:02:05.597 --> 01:02:06.598
How could it not be?

01:02:16.942 --> 01:02:20.403
-  Would you care to respond? -  Ms. Seong, over here.

01:02:29.120 --> 01:02:31.705
The snacks Your Majesty sent for Children's Day

01:02:31.706 --> 01:02:35.793
brought great joy to all the patients in the pediatric ward.

01:02:35.794 --> 01:02:38.213
I am more than happy to help in any way I can.

01:02:38.838 --> 01:02:41.341
Do not hesitate to let me know.

01:02:41.967 --> 01:02:45.010
I heard Your Majesty enjoyed my performances.

01:02:45.011 --> 01:02:48.348
If Your Majesty could attend the next one, I would be greatly honored…

01:02:58.984 --> 01:03:00.609
Perhaps the summer is to thank,

01:03:00.610 --> 01:03:03.904
but do you not find the palace grounds even more beautiful?

01:03:03.905 --> 01:03:05.031
Pardon?

01:03:05.699 --> 01:03:07.117
Yes, Your Majesty.

01:03:08.076 --> 01:03:09.369
Let us walk a bit longer.

01:03:09.869 --> 01:03:12.872
When the flowers are in bloom, appreciating them is one's duty.

01:03:13.456 --> 01:03:15.166
- Yes, Your Majesty. - Yes, Your Majesty.

01:04:07.177 --> 01:04:08.636
Please teach me.

01:04:10.722 --> 01:04:11.973
Now that I am by your side.

01:04:13.808 --> 01:04:15.810
:cue

01:04:52.013 --> 01:04:53.181
Do not bend to their will.

01:04:54.933 --> 01:04:55.934
Do not step back

01:04:56.851 --> 01:04:58.103
and do not compromise.

01:05:00.188 --> 01:05:01.731
I shall fight with all that I have.

01:05:06.861 --> 01:05:07.862
Just as you do.

01:05:22.919 --> 01:05:25.921
PERFECT CROWN

01:06:01.916 --> 01:06:05.002
From when you were just acquaintances to now,

01:06:05.003 --> 01:06:06.795
what would you say is the biggest change?

01:06:06.796 --> 01:06:08.422
Being overprotective?

01:06:08.423 --> 01:06:09.423
That's a bit too naive, no?

01:06:09.424 --> 01:06:13.469
A businesswoman should know better than to trust people so easily.

01:06:14.053 --> 01:06:15.555
There's a spy at my private residence.

01:06:16.222 --> 01:06:17.472
Seong Huiju!

01:06:17.473 --> 01:06:20.185
Don't you find him to be so impatient?

01:06:22.353 --> 01:06:23.729
Your Royal Highness?

01:06:23.730 --> 01:06:25.814
Will you give me your hand in marriage?

01:06:25.815 --> 01:06:27.941
Did you think I would simply let this stand?

01:06:27.942 --> 01:06:29.151
Announce me.

01:06:29.152 --> 01:06:31.988
How could I refuse a request from the Queen Mother?

01:06:33.198 --> 01:06:35.074
You should only have eyes for me.

01:06:35.575 --> 01:06:37.911
As if we were hopelessly in love.

01:06:45.043 --> 01:06:52.050
EPILOGUE

01:06:55.720 --> 01:06:57.722
Oh!

01:07:12.862 --> 01:07:13.863
Wait.

01:07:15.573 --> 01:07:16.574
You…

01:07:20.370 --> 01:07:21.454
You did well

01:07:22.413 --> 01:07:23.748
during the exhibition match.

01:07:26.876 --> 01:07:29.879
Are you trying to take credit?

01:07:32.966 --> 01:07:34.091
"Take credit"?

01:07:34.092 --> 01:07:36.219
Do you not grasp the concept of a compliment?

01:07:38.596 --> 01:07:39.639
I guess not.

01:08:12.922 --> 01:08:14.465
Darn it, you scared me.

01:08:15.550 --> 01:08:16.968
Have you been there?

01:08:17.510 --> 01:08:18.636
- Yes. - Since when?

01:08:19.887 --> 01:08:21.722
Before you started lingering.

01:08:35.194 --> 01:08:37.238
Are you close to Seong Huiju?

01:08:39.949 --> 01:08:41.993
We're close. We live in the same dorms too.

01:08:43.286 --> 01:08:44.495
What is she like?

01:08:52.128 --> 01:08:53.338
She's pretty.

01:08:55.340 --> 01:08:56.632
Yeah, she is.

01:09:08.895 --> 01:09:10.979
Translated by Justin S. Kim

01:09:22.241 --> 01:09:25.912
PERFECT CROWN

